<section class="ls-visual-episode ls-container">
<div class="ls-episode-copy">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">LOCAL OR CLOUD. VISIBLE BY DESIGN.</p>
<h2>KNOW THE MODEL.<br/>
<span class="ls-stroke">KNOW THE BOUNDARY.</span>
</h2>
<div class="ls-episode-dek">
<p>Use Flow Runtime, Ollama or LM Studio on your Mac. Bring your OpenAI, Anthropic or OpenRouter API key for configured daytime work.</p>
<p>Benchmark model fit and speed on your hardware. Smart Routing shows the rule behind its choice.</p>
</div>
<a class="ls-text-link" href="/flow/models-and-runtime/">Explore models and runtime<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
<figure aria-label="Know where the work runs" class="ls-scene ls-route-scene" data-frame="0" data-scene="true" data-scene-count="2">
