</path>
</svg> A passage you selected</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
<span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-git-branch" fill="none" height="19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M15 6a9 9 0 0 0-9 9V3">
</path>
<circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3">
</circle>
<circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3">
