</path>
<path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4">
</path>
</svg>
<b>Night Shift stays here.</b> Overnight model work uses a local model.</p>
<p data-scene-panel="1" hidden="">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-globe" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10">
</circle>
<path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20">
</path>
<path d="M2 12h20">
</path>
</svg>
<b>A visible boundary.</b> Selected text goes to your chosen provider when you run the action.</p>
</div>
<p class="ls-scene-note">Smart Routing names the model and deciding rule. Public Web Lookups are a separate opt-in, off by default.</p>
</div>
